---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import avatar from "../assets/images/avatar.png";
---

<div id="left-intro">
<div id="intro-heading">
  Hi, I'm <span class="accent">Marina</span>.<br />
  <span id="sub-heading">I make complex software easier to understand.</span><br />
</div>
  <div id="intro-description">
<p>
  I'm currently a <strong>Senior UX Writer</strong> at Turnitin, where I create
  documentation, knowledge systems, and in-product content that helps people
  understand and use complex software.
</p>

<p>
  Before joining Turnitin, I worked in libraries supporting and documenting
  technical systems. That experience continues to shape how I approach
  documentation today, grounding my work in real user needs and practical
  problem-solving.
</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="right-intro">
  <div id="intro-image">
    <Image src={avatar} alt="A graphic of Marina" />
  </div>
</div>
